description = Color(After prohibition came to Aracena VI, [PAWN_nameDef] expanded [PAWN_possessive] underground liquor business until it dominated the market on two continents. They called [PAWN_objective] the Vinho King.\n\nThough [PAWN_pronoun] mostly controlled [PAWN_possessive] competition by masterful political maneuvering, [PAWN_pronoun] was not above the occasional beat-down or stiletto assassination., 1.0)
